        "created_at": "2014-06-07T14:48:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><font color=\"green\"><span class=\"bbcode-i\">&lt;Split from <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/advanced-voss-and-sub-zero-atmosphere-5359\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Advanced Voss and Sub-Zero Atmosphere</a>&gt;</span></font></p>\n<p>A quick side-question on Forced Deployment to make sure I understand it correctly: if Voss had 0 minions and was flipped, he a Forced Deployment would not cause him to flip back until the next round, correct? (For the same reason that you'd check the start of turn effects on Voss before Forced Deployment)</p>",
