        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[color=green][i]&lt;Split from <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/advanced-voss-and-sub-zero-atmosphere-5359\">Advanced Voss and Sub-Zero Atmosphere</a>&gt;[/i][/color]\n\nA quick side-question on Forced Deployment to make sure I understand it correctly: if Voss had 0 minions and was flipped, he a Forced Deployment would not cause him to flip back until the next round, correct? (For the same reason that you&#39;d check the start of turn effects on Voss before Forced Deployment)\n",
