        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>That pretty much answers my question, but the scenario I came across was that Voss was flipped the same turn Forced Deployment came out (which sucked). Voss still had 2 minions out when&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Forced Deployment was played. As the turn came around, the 2 minions were KO&#39;d (environment, I&#39;m sure). Turn started, so I flipped Voss since he had no minions. Forced Deployment then gets destroyed and so all the minions from the trash (like... 5 or something that game) come out. I assumed that Voss wouldn&#39;t get flipped back, despite the fact that it is still the &quot;start of the villain phase&quot; and he now has more than 1 minion. Just wanted to make sure.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">(And yeah, that end of villain turn sucked.)</span></p>",
